    {
      "uid": "zhcn:379f1fd6441110e88cf68eaf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新光风对看着有点哀伤的山羊宣誓。\n或许是对山羊感同身受吧，她的语调听起来甚至很可靠──",
      "source_fingerprint": "994cabfac634c0397d944911acdd472609a7de40f97a77bc017853e09571710f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
