        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e48442560841c6799509cd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这时我想到一件事，她的创意能不能用在这种时候呢？\n只用在恶作剧上太可惜了，能不能善用这个天分？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f11069b0b7ded2014c13324a786c949171426eb17132aa7a47412c55371d407",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
